            <a href="https://www.acm.org/publications/proceedings-template" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download ACM templates</a>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Page limits: Research papers: 9 pages; System demonstrations: 4 pages</li>
            <li>References and appendices do not count toward the page limit</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mt-4">Before You Submit</h3>
          <ul>
